# Media for review goes in the reply
CursorQuota phone shows media only when the reply names it (#1660)—not tool-only or desktop-only paths.

- Name each review file by absolute path as a markdown link or backticks: `![home](/Users/Apple/.../home.png)`, `[clip](</path with spaces/clip.mp4>)`.
- Write the file before that reply. Phone formats: `.mp4` (H.264/AAC), `.webm`/`.mov`; `.mp3`/`.wav`/`.m4a`; `.png`/`.jpg`/`.gif`/`.webp`.
- Don't ask him to open the desktop to look.
